-*   **Neural Field:** A compact 4-layer Multi-Layer Perceptron (MLP). Unlike standard NeRF, it does not use positional encoding and does not condition on view directions (view-independent).
-*   **Ray Sampling:** 2048 rays are sampled per mini-batch.
